---
// TeamContentSection component for the team page
---

<section class="team-content">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content-wrapper">
      <div class="team-image">
        <div class="image-container">
          <div class="image-placeholder">
            <div class="placeholder-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                <path d="M12 2L13.09 8.26L20 9L13.09 9.74L12 16L10.91 9.74L4 9L10.91 8.26L12 2Z" fill="currentColor"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <p class="image-text">Photo with Resolved Team Working</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="team-text">
        <div class="subtitle">
          <span>Hippogriff feint us cannot</span>
          <div class="subtitle-line"></div>
        </div>
        <h2>Together as a Team we're Resolved Law Group</h2>
        <div class="description">
          <p>Shrieking flame lion seeker stone thirsty prophecies newt duel. Better points kidney die giant splinched minerva hand aragog shrieking. Bag pumpkin in seven cup goblin. Duel cabbage pear-tickle are bee spew wizard levicorpus.</p>
          
          <p>&nbsp;</p>
          
          <p>Hagrid tears grim do law snivellus bedroom portkey order plums. Fluffy got newt stone betrayal tweak. Doxycide knut snitch eeylops patronus. Sight maze scabbers wingardium umbrella pear-tickle black mudbloods.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/about" class="cta-button">
          More About our Firm
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .team-content {
    background-color: var(--secondary-background);
    padding: 0 0 96px 0;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: var(--container-max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--container-padding);
  }

  .content-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    gap: 138px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .team-image {
    flex: 0 0 498px;
    height: 600px;
  }

  .image-container {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .image-placeholder {
    background-color: var(--main-content);
    border-radius: 5px;
    box-shadow: 8px 8px 0px 0px var(--dark-background);
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .placeholder-icon {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    color: var(--light-text);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .image-text {
    font-family: var(--font-main);
    font-size: 50px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--light-text);
    text-align: center;
    opacity: 0.2;
    line-height: 1.25;
    max-width: 420px;
  }

  .team-text {
    flex: 0 0 604px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .subtitle {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .subtitle span {
    font-family: var(--font-secondary);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--main-accent-light);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  .subtitle-line {
    width: 198px;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: var(--main-accent-light);
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-main);
    font-size: 50px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--light-text);
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .description {
    font-family: var(--font-secondary);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--light-text);
  }

  .description p {
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .cta-button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--sunset);
    border-radius: 5px;
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--main-content);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: var(--font-secondary);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    align-self: flex-start;
  }

  .cta-button:hover {
    background-color: var(--main-accent-light);
    color: var(--main-content);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1440px) {
    .container {
      padding: 0 2rem;
    }
    
    .content-wrapper {
      gap: 4rem;
    }
    
    h2 {
      font-size: 40px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .content-wrapper {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    
    .team-image {
      flex: none;
      height: 300px;
    }
    
    .team-text {
      flex: none;
    }
    
    h2 {
      font-size: 32px;
    }
    
    .image-text {
      font-size: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
